<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP WINNERS' CUP AND UEFA CUP DRAWS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP WINNERS' CUP AND UEFA CUP DRAWS.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draws for the quarter-final stage of the European Cup Winners' Cup and UEFA Cup made on Wednesday:</p>
<p>UEFA Cup</p>
<p>Newcastle United (England) v Monaco (France)</p>
<p>Tenerife (Spain) v Brondby (Denmark)</p>
<p>Schalke (Germany) v Valencia (Spain)</p>
<p>Anderlelcht (Belgium) v Internazionale Milan (Italy)</p>
<p>First leg to be played on March 4 with the return leg on March 18.</p>
<p>Cup Winners' Cup</p>
<p>Benfica (Portugal) v Fiorentina (Italy)</p>
<p>Paris St Germain (France) v AEK Athens (Greece)</p>
<p>Brann Bergen (Norway) v Liverpool (England)</p>
<p>Barcelona (Spain) v AIK Stockholm (Sweden)</p>
<p>First leg to be played on March 6 and second leg March 20.</p>
</text>
